# Frontend Rules

## Architecture

- Functional TypeScript components only; feature/component layout under `frontend/src/`.
- Server state: React Query. Client state: Zustand or Redux Toolkit.
- Centralized Axios instance with JWT + refresh + error interceptors.
- Lazy-load / code-split routes. Responsive: **375px** and **1440px**.

## UI (Modern Zen)

- Tokens from `docs/DESIGN.md` / `docs/component-library.md` via Tailwind.
- Fonts: **Outfit** (headings), **Plus Jakarta Sans** (body).
- Primary: `#0F766E` (hover `#0D9488`). Canvas `#F8FAFC`, cards white.
- Status badges: semantic color at **10% opacity** — never harsh solid fills.
- WCAG 2.1 AA; every input has a real `<label>`; visible focus rings (no bare `outline: none`).
- Buttons need loading/disabled states. Prefer toast over `window.alert()`.

## API client

```ts
// Success/error envelope from backend — type against this shape
type ApiResponse<T> = { success: boolean; message: string; data?: T; errors?: { field: string; message: string }[] };
```

- Auth header: `Authorization: Bearer <access_token>`
- Lists: paginate with `?page=&size=&sort=`
